WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.840
So this is Dave.

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.200
Dave has five credit cards.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.000
Dave has no idea what any of them do.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.080
The bank mailed him a forty-seven page booklet once.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.080
He used it to level a table.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.960
So Dave grabs the blue one.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.760
The blue one earns one percent on groceries.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.800
The green one earns five.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.640
Dave will never know this.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.320
His money app wanted to help.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.320
It offered him a sixth card.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.360
Nobody was going to tell Dave which card to use.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.080
Well.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.320
Almost nobody.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.440
Witch Card.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.840
Open it at the register.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.280
It knows where you are, and pulls out the card that earns the most.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.080
The rest of your wallet sits under it, ranked.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:38.960
No ads.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.040
No sponsors.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.040
Ninety-nine cents, once.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.730
tompkinssoftwaresystems.com/witch-card
